{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan an Nasai","section":{"26":{"eng-name":"The Book of Marriage","ara-name":"كتاب النكاح"}},"section_detail":{"26":{"hadithnumber_first":3196,"hadithnumber_last":3388,"arabicnumber_first":3196,"arabicnumber_last":3388}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":3210,"arabicnumber":3210,"text":"Rapporté par 'Abdullah : Il a été rapporté que 'Abdullah a dit : \"Le Messager d'Allah nous a dit : 'Ô jeunes gens, que celui d'entre vous qui en a les moyens se marie,'\" et il a rapporté le même hadith","grades":[{"name":"Abu Ghuddah","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Hasan"}],"reference":{"book":26,"hadith":15},"chapter":{"id":3,"ara-name":"باب الْحَثِّ عَلَى النِّكَاحِ .","eng-name":"Encouragement To Marry","isFirstHadith":false}}]}